{"id":"u-af75101b-d912-486a-9dbb-41755d922c5d","src":"community","title":"Bodybuilding Program - Basement Bodybuilding","author":"Roshen T.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/patvn3-bodybuilding-program-basement-bodybuilding","desc":"Transform your physique with the Basement Bodybuilding Program, an 18-week journey designed for dedicated lifters looking to build muscle and strength. Committing just four days a week, you'll engage in a structured routine that targets all major muscle groups, ensuring balanced development and optimal gains. This program emphasizes progressive overload and effective training techniques, making it ideal for anyone serious about enhancing their bodybuilding skills. Get ready to unleash your potential and sculpt the body you've always wanted!","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":9,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T03:09:18.749Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Pull A","Push A","Pull B","Push B"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Stiff Leg Deadlift","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":6,"x":3}],"note":"Pull bar from the floor, knees behind ankles, can have little back rounding. touch and go. 1-3 reps in the tank."},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":3}],"note":"just outside shoulder width, pronated grip, elbows tucked into scapular plane. Focus on packing shoulders down, shorten the lats."},{"n":"T-Bar Row","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":3}],"note":"chest-supported preferred. Flare elbows, squeeze traps. Think about driving clavicles up and back"},{"n":"Preacher Curl (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":7,"x":3}],"note":"Close Grip"},{"n":"Single Arm Rear Delt Fly (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":2}],"note":"cross body from high to low angle"},{"n":"Decline Crunch (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Smith Feet Up Bench","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":7,"x":4}]},{"n":"60° Smith Press","sets":[{"lo":7,"hi":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Powell Raise","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":2}],"note":"on flat bench"},{"n":"Overhead Extension (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":4}]},{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":3}],"note":"controlled"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Lat Pulldown (Single Arm)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":3}],"note":"high to low, hammer strength machine. Lean into it a bit, neutral grip preferred (D handle attachment)"},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":5}],"note":"Narrow attachment or WG attachment."},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":5}],"note":"seated arms by side. AMRAP to 90 degrees. then 1-3 involuntary partial reps."},{"n":"Rear Delt Fly (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"x":2}]},{"n":"Seated Hamstring Curl","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":3}],"note":"to failure"}]},{"ex":[{"n":"30° Smith Press","sets":[{"lo":7,"hi":9,"x":4}],"note":"mid peck level, little arch,"},{"n":"Smith BTN Press","sets":[{"lo":7,"hi":9,"x":3}],"note":"ribs down, abs flexed, goal is to 1-2 sec pause on traps."},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":15,"hi":20,"x":3}],"note":"very strict. hands right by outside of thighs, raise 15 degrees in front of you. abs flexed, fight to maintain technique. chase grindy reps."},{"n":"JM Press (Smith Machine)","sets":[{"lo":7,"hi":9,"x":3}],"note":"bar land in b/w front of chin and clavicles. at bottom elbows above shoulders, but below wrists."},{"n":"Leg Press (45 Degrees)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":3}]}]}],[{"ex":[{"n":"Stiff Leg Deadlift","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":6,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"T-Bar Row","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Preacher Curl (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":7,"x":3}],"note":"Close Grip"},{"n":"Single Arm Rear Delt Fly (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Smith Feet Up Bench","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":7,"x":4}]},{"n":"60° Smith Press","sets":[{"lo":7,"hi":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Powell Raise","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":2}]},{"n":"Overhead Extension (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":4}]},{"